      "section": "验签机制",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-role-info-0000002075016173#section205561419163916",
      "text": "signature.verify(Base64.decodeBase64(sign)); // sign是Header中的字段，即请求时传递的签名"
